# Equivalence-harness goldens are immutable reference data captured from a named
# pre-migration build. Keep their bytes exactly as written: line-ending
# normalisation would rewrite a file that is supposed to never change, and make
# "the golden set is unmodified" harder to state than it should be.
#
# The harness parses on \R and so tolerates either ending; this is about the
# artifact being byte-stable, not about the parser.
*.golden -text
